<title>USA: Bridgeport Machines sees Q1 sales level.</title>
<headline>Bridgeport Machines sees Q1 sales level.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGEPORT, Conn. 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bridgeport Machines Inc said Monday fourth quarter earnings and sales fell due to continually weak market conditions in continental Europe and expects sales to remain level for the first quarter of fiscal 1998 compared to the previous quarter.</p>
<p>In the fourth quarter of 1997, the company said conditions in Europe were soft for a third consecutive quarter and that results were compounded by the strong pound sterling.</p>
</text>
